get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/eng/twins
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The plants ENG holds designs for.

  Expect at least ACME-SANDBOX, the default twin. It is created on the first write
  that names no twin, so a freshly reset sandbox may show it only after 06 has run.
}
